message: "If you use this software, data or finding, please cite it as below."
title: "Fallen: a live map of space debris re-entering Earth, and who records what reaches the ground"
abstract: >-
  A live map of satellites and rocket bodies re-entering Earth, showing each object's possible path over its
  prediction window, the population beneath it and its launching state under the 1972 UN Liability Convention.
  It includes an analysis of ESA's recovered-debris list showing that high-income countries hold 43% of recorded
  finds but only 12% of population-weighted exposure.
type: software
